---
const fonts = [
  {
    letter: 'A',
    name: 'Cormorant Garamond',
    css: '"Cormorant Garamond", serif',
    weight: 500,
    italic: 300,
    note: 'Clássica, atemporal, italic gracioso',
  },
  {
    letter: 'B',
    name: 'Playfair Display',
    css: '"Playfair Display", serif',
    weight: 500,
    italic: 500,
    note: 'Alto contraste, dramática, editorial revista',
  },
  {
    letter: 'C',
    name: 'DM Serif Display',
    css: '"DM Serif Display", serif',
    weight: 400,
    italic: 400,
    note: 'Contemporânea, traços largos, personalidade marcante',
  },
  {
    letter: 'D',
    name: 'Spectral',
    css: '"Spectral", serif',
    weight: 500,
    italic: 400,
    note: 'Humanista, equilibrada, tom literário',
  },
  {
    letter: 'E',
    name: 'Cabinet Grotesk',
    css: '"Cabinet Grotesk", sans-serif',
    weight: 500,
    italic: 500,
    note: 'Sans geométrica moderna com calor (quebra serif)',
  },
  {
    letter: 'F',
    name: 'Newsreader',
    css: '"Newsreader", serif',
    weight: 500,
    italic: 400,
    note: 'Display variable, calígrafica, italic refinado',
  },
  {
    letter: '0',
    name: 'Fraunces (atual)',
    css: '"Fraunces Variable", "Fraunces", serif',
    weight: 350,
    italic: 350,
    note: 'A fonte aplicada hoje no hero',
  },
];
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Comparação de fontes — Rua da Passagem 149</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,300;1,400;1,500&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700;1,400;1,500&family=DM+Serif+Display:ital@0;1&family=Spectral:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,300;1,400;1,500&family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,12..72,400;0,12..72,500;0,12..72,600;1,12..72,400;1,12..72,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500&display=swap"
    />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://api.fontshare.com/v2/css?f[]=cabinet-grotesk@400,500,700&display=swap"
    />

    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@fontsource-variable/fraunces@5/index.css"
    />

    <style>
      :root {
        --canvas: oklch(98.5% 0.005 80);
        --bone: oklch(96% 0.012 75);
        --ink: oklch(22% 0.008 240);
        --stone: oklch(65% 0.008 240);
        --bronze: oklch(65% 0.080 65);
      }

      * { box-sizing: border-box; }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--canvas);
        color: var(--ink);
        font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.5;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }

      .page-head {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 4rem 2rem 2rem;
      }

      .page-head h1 {
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
        color: var(--stone);
      }

      .page-head p {
        margin: 0;
        max-width: 60ch;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-size: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      .page-head a {
        display: inline-block;
        margin-top: 1.5rem;
        color: var(--bronze);
        text-decoration: underline;
        text-underline-offset: 4px;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      }

      .sample {
        max-width: 1200px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 3rem 2rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid color-mix(in oklch, var(--ink), transparent 88%);
      }

      .sample:last-of-type {
        border-bottom: 0;
        padding-bottom: 7rem;
      }

      .sample__head {
        display: flex;
        align-items: baseline;
        gap: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      }

      .sample__letter {
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        color: var(--bronze);
        letter-spacing: 0.2em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem;
        background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--bronze), transparent 88%);
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in oklch, var(--bronze), transparent 70%);
      }

      .sample__name {
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        font-weight: 500;
        font-size: 1.05rem;
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--ink);
      }

      .sample__note {
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        font-size: 0.85rem;
        color: var(--stone);
        margin: 0;
        flex: 1;
        text-align: right;
      }

      @media (max-width: 700px) {
        .sample__head {
          flex-direction: column;
          align-items: flex-start;
          gap: 0.5rem;
        }
        .sample__note {
          text-align: left;
        }
      }

      .sample__display {
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 6rem);
        line-height: 1;
        margin: 0 0 1rem;
        letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      }

      .sample__display-it {
        font-style: italic;
        display: block;
      }

      .sample__sub {
        font-style: italic;
        font-weight: 300;
        font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
        margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
        color: color-mix(in oklch, var(--ink), transparent 30%);
      }

      .sample__alpha {
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
        margin: 0;
        color: color-mix(in oklch, var(--ink), transparent 40%);
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1>Comparação de fontes</h1>
      <p>
        Cada bloco abaixo mostra o título atual do hero ("A casa que projetamos / <em>para morar.</em>"),
        a frase de apoio ("Pronta para ser a sua.") e um pangrama em ASCII para você ver tipos numéricos
        e acentos. O bloco <strong>0</strong> no final é a fonte atualmente aplicada (Fraunces) — usa como
        referência.
      </p>
      <a href="./">← voltar pra landing</a>
    </header>

    {fonts.map((f) => (
      <section class="sample">
        <div class="sample__head">
          <span class="sample__letter">Opção {f.letter}</span>
          <h2 class="sample__name">{f.name}</h2>
          <p class="sample__note">{f.note}</p>
        </div>

        <h3 class="sample__display" style={`font-family: ${f.css}; font-weight: ${f.weight};`}>
          A casa que projetamos
          <span class="sample__display-it" style={`font-family: ${f.css}; font-weight: ${f.italic};`}>
            para morar.
          </span>
        </h3>

        <p class="sample__sub" style={`font-family: ${f.css};`}>
          Pronta para ser a sua.
        </p>

        <p class="sample__alpha" style={`font-family: ${f.css}; font-weight: ${f.weight};`}>
          Rua da Passagem 149 · 94 m² · R$ 2.360.000 — Botafogo, Rio de Janeiro
        </p>
      </section>
    ))}
  </body>
</html>
